  "body": "Sure, sorry for not providing it before: I experience this bug on the current git build, that I build myself on Fedora 43, but this but has been around for quite awhile, just I haven't been able to report it before.\n\nThis is an example on what happens when opening a file with a previously saved .arp profile and wavelet smoothing enabled:\n<img width=\"369\" height=\"898\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61b29035-dc0b-49c5-9df9-ed2177162d20\" />\nAs you can see,  the shown parameters (not in the list, the ones that you can change below) are from another method. Then, if you change to another method and then back to wavelet, you get this:\n\n<img width=\"369\" height=\"454\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2721aedd-be15-40f6-b335-4b05c9ca7aad\" />",
